------------------------------- MODULE test55 -------------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals

----------------------------- MODULE test55a -----------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals

VARIABLES x, y

Init == x = 0 /\ y = 0

F == x \in {0, 1}

G == y \in {0, 1}

Step == /\ x' = 1 - x
        /\ y' = 1 - y

SafeSpec == Init /\ [][Step]_<<x, y>>

LiveSpec == []<>(x = 1) /\ []<>(x = 0)
